      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.18981635,
        "t": 638.8332568,
        "r": 545.3889124000002,
        "b": 627.3113612999999
      },
      "content": "The maximum total pipe length (including interconnecting piping between compressor and receiver) can 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0692",
