      "reading_order": 1036,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94900735000003,
        "t": 560.4114012499999,
        "r": 343.5057906500002,
        "b": 548.89140575
      },
      "content": "p = Absolute pressure at the compressor outlet in bar(a)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0697",
      "reading_order": 1037,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94900735000003,
        "t": 543.7911800999999,
        "r": 298.87543409999995,
        "b": 532.2711846
      },
      "content": "Qc = Free air delivery of the compressor in l/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0698",
      "reading_order": 1038,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.18981635,
        "t": 526.45242265,
        "r": 540.2323479500006,
        "b": 501.01109925
      },
      "content": "Ventilation: the inlet grids and ventilation fan should be installed in such a way that any recirculation of cooling air to the compressor or dryer is avoided. The maximum air velocity through the grids is 5m/s. 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0699",
      "reading_order": 1039,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94900735000003,
        "t": 495.73084114999995,
        "r": 529.2389213500011,
        "b": 470.3504283
      },
      "content": "The maximum air temperature at the compressor intake is 46 °C (minimum 0 °C). For air-cooled compressors ventilation alternatives 1 and 3, the ventilation capacity required to limit the"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0700",
      "reading_order": 1040,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.95,
        "t": 468.6721915,
        "r": 324.4722541500001,
        "b": 452.47219600000005
      },
      "content": "b l l Qv = 1.06 N/dT for GA Workplace compressors"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0701",
      "reading_order": 1041,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 325.53183165000013,
        "t": 468.6721915,
        "r": 331.31784565000015,
        "b": 457.152196
      },
      "content": "d"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
