      },
      "content": "ll"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0704",
      "reading_order": 1044,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.95,
        "t": 446.65184055000003,
        "r": 403.44093875,
        "b": 435.13184505000004
      },
      "content": "Qv = (1.06 N + 8)/dT for GA Workplace Full-Feature compressors"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0705",
      "reading_order": 1045,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.95,
        "t": 432.07129340000006,
        "r": 316.4592491500004,
        "b": 420.55129790000007
      },
      "content": "The cooling air of the dryer can be ducted outside"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0706",
      "reading_order": 1046,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.95,
        "t": 416.14131249999997,
        "r": 281.2711994000001,
        "b": 401.83104505000006
      },
      "content": "Qv= Required ventilation capacity in m 3 /s"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0707",
      "reading_order": 1047,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94944870000006,
        "t": 397.39174245,
        "r": 262.30847510000035,
        "b": 385.87174695
      },
      "content": "N = Shaft input of compressor in kW"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0708",
      "reading_order": 1048,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94944870000006,
        "t": 382.8111953,
        "r": 333.97595929999994,
        "b": 371.2911998
      },
      "content": "dT = Temperature increase in compressor room in °C"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0709",
      "reading_order": 1049,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94944870000006,
        "t": 366.6707138,
        "r": 548.3123959000006,
        "b": 340.75124425
      },
      "content": "For ventilation alternatives 2 and 4: the fan capacity should match the compressor fan capacity at a pressure head equal to the pressure drop over the air ducts."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0710",
      "reading_order": 1050,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94944870000006,
        "t": 337.57101785000003,
        "r": 550.4478097000015,
        "b": 312.8514177500001
      },
      "content": "For water-cooled compressors, the ventilation capacity required to limit the compressor room temperature can be calculated from:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0711",
      "reading_order": 1051,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94944870000006,
        "t": 307.8708668500001,
        "r": 324.4717028500001,
        "b": 296.35087135000003
      },
      "content": "Qv = 0.13 N/dT for GA Workplace compressors"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0712",
      "reading_order": 1052,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94944870000006,
        "t": 292.6305476,
        "r": 403.44038745,
        "b": 281.11055210000006
      },
      "content": "Qv = (0.13 N + 8)/dT for GA Workplace Full-Feature compressors"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0713",
      "reading_order": 1053,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94944870000006,
        "t": 276.67009855000003,
        "r": 442.7998517500006,
        "b": 265.1501030500001
      },
      "content": "Max. allowable pressure drop in ducting before or after the compressor = 30 Pa"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0714",
      "reading_order": 1054,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.18925700000005,
        "t": 261.42977930000006,
        "r": 545.3704783499999,
        "b": 222.12963205000005
      },
      "content": "5 The drain pipes to the drain collector must not dip into the water of the drain collector. Atlas Copco has oil/water separators (type OSD or OSCi) to separate the major part of the oil from the condensate to ensure that the condensate meets the requiremen"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0715",
      "reading_order": 1055,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.18925700000005,
        "t": 219.78921019999996,
        "r": 263.0400520500001,
        "b": 208.26921470000002
      },
      "content": "6 Control module with monitoring panel."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0716",
      "reading_order": 1056,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.18981635,
        "t": 202.45124840000005,
        "r": 401.3112175500006,
        "b": 190.92886375
      },
      "content": "Power supply cable to be sized and installed by a qualified electrician. 7"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0717",
      "reading_order": 1057,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.94944870000006,
        "t": 184.38837850000004,
        "r": 540.2307080000008,
        "b": 159.00796564999996
      },
      "content": "To preserve the protection degree of the electric cubicle and to protect its components from dust from the environment, it is mandatory to use a proper cable gland when connecting the supply cable to the"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0718",
      "reading_order": 1058,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.18925700000005,
        "t": 153.84738229999994,
        "r": 264.4782303499997,
        "b": 142.3273868
      },
      "content": "8 Provision for energy recovery system."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0719",
      "reading_order": 1059,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.18925700000005,
        "t": 135.84725924999998,
        "r": 542.4187136499999,
        "b": 93.79177864999997
      },
      "content": "9 Filter, type DD for general purposes. The filter traps solid particles down to 1 micron with a max. oil carry-over of 0.5 mg/m 3 . A high-efficiency filter, type PD, maybe installed downstream of a DD filter. This filter traps solid particles down to 0.01 m"
    },
